# throwaway debug copy of the game, regenerated with instrumentation while testing
dbg.html
# screenshots dropped by the headless test scripts. The old rule only caught the shot-
# prefix, so a batch named hs_* rode into a commit unnoticed — this matches any PNG at
# the top level, and there are no real ones there to lose.
*.png
# except anything deliberately kept
!docs/*.png
# playwright and its chromium are installed per-container, not vendored — package.json
# and the lockfile are committed so `npm install` reproduces the harness exactly.
node_modules/
# one-off measurement scripts. The game is served from the repo root, so a probe has to
# live here to import playwright at all — which makes it very easy to commit one.
probe.tmp.mjs
